codex
The feature set is frozen and the 30-anchor held-out replay is underway. The early two-anchor inspection already showed the decisive target-side input difference: anchor 0 tests survival over 94 users whose candidate mapping differs from its future `nearest-eligible` transition, while anchor 1 tests only focal user 6 against `stay-if-possible`; the candidate configuration and current committed mapping are otherwise identical.
