The focused reproduction now completes in about 31 seconds and confirms the decisive condition: the two anchors have identical current base mappings and Q rows, but the exact forecast predicate ranges over 93 changed users for anchor 0 versus one focal user for anchor 1. It emits stored survival `(1,1,1)` for both and exact survival `(0,0,0)` versus `(1,1,1)`.
